B.a2h=new A.fa(["Rider ownership","How do I stop renting and start owning?","Pay a one-time programme deposit \u2014 from \u20a6400,000 for a Bajaj Boxer or \u20a62,300,000 for an approved Maruwa tricycle \u2014 take part for the three- or six-month programme, and own the vehicle. There is no further vehicle payment under the ownership offer. Applications are reviewed and verified by our own staff before anything is approved.",B.hH])
B.a2l=new A.fa(["Training & capacity","How do I stay safe and earn more?","Rider training comes with the programme at no extra charge: road safety, basic maintenance and how to protect the asset you now own. A rider who can fix a minor fault himself keeps working through the week.",B.tw])
B.a2m=new A.fa(["Logistics & haulage","Who can move goods dependably?","Our rider network handles last-mile delivery and haulage across our operating states. Partners get a vetted, trained, vehicle-owning fleet rather than a queue of renters with no stake in the job.",B.ts])
B.a2r=new A.fa(["Sustainable solutions","What else can I add to the business?","Sun King solar home systems from \u20a650,000 \u2014 panel, LED lighting, phone charging and TV support \u2014 so the income a vehicle earns can go further at home, and so a shop can stay open after dark.",B.tJ])
B.Vx=s([B.a2h,B.a2l,B.a2m,B.a2r],t._d)
B.Vy=s([120,120,20,45,20,15,20,120,120],t.n)
B.Vz=s([B.rn,B.rl,B.rh,B.ri,B.rj,B.rm,B.rk],t.UR)
B.agV=new A.fA("Applying","How do I apply for a slot?",'Tap "Apply for a slot" and fill the form \u2014 your details, your riding experience, the programme you want, your finances and your documents. It takes about ten minutes and works on any phone. Prefer a hand? Message us on WhatsApp and our team will walk through it with you.')
B.agW=new A.fA("Applying","How much does it cost to apply?","Nothing. Applying is completely free \u2014 no fee, no charge, no purchase required. You only pay a deposit after your application has been approved, and it goes to Teamak Global Solutions directly, never to an individual.")
B.agP=new A.fA("Applying","What do I need before I start?","Your NIN, a passport photograph, your rider or association registration, and proof of where you live. Section E of the form asks which of these you already have, so you know exactly what to arrange before the verification visit.")
B.agU=new A.fA("Applying","Can I apply again if I am not approved?",'Yes. A "Not approved" decision is about that application only. When the next intake opens, apply again \u2014 and message us if you would like to understand what held the first one back.')
B.agT=new A.fA("Verification","What happens after I submit?",'Your application starts as "Submitted", then moves to "Under review". Our verification team calls you on the number you gave and invites you to a visit where the originals of your documents are checked. Every step appears live on your dashboard.')
B.agX=new A.fA("Verification","Why do you check originals?","A verification visit confirms that what is on the form matches the person and the documents behind it. It protects you as much as it protects the programme \u2014 a slot confirmed honestly is a slot that holds.")
B.agZ=new A.fA("Verification","How do I know what to bring to verification?",'Your dashboard shows it. The "Getting ready for verification" card lists every document and marks it "Ready" or "Arrange" based on your own answers \u2014 bring everything marked "Arrange" to the visit.')
B.agR=new A.fA("Approval & payment","When do I pay the deposit?","Only after approval, and only to Teamak Global Solutions through the arrangement our team confirms with you. Nobody from Teamak will ever ask you to send money to a personal account \u2014 if that happens, it is not us. Report it to us on WhatsApp.")
B.agS=new A.fA("Approval & payment","What do the programmes cost?","There are three ownership tracks, each with a one-time programme deposit: Okada \u20a6650,000 (3-month programme), Okada \u20a6400,000 (6-month programme), and Maruwa \u20a62,300,000 (3-month programme). The deposit covers the machine \u2014 there is no further vehicle payment under the ownership offer. The programme you pick in the form is what staff confirm with you at approval.")
B.agO=new A.fA("Approval & payment","What if my application needs more time?",'Some checks take longer than others. If that happens your status shows "Further review" \u2014 we will reach out if anything else is needed from you, and there is nothing you need to do meanwhile.')
B.agQ=new A.fA("Ownership","What happens at handover?","Once your deposit is confirmed, our team arranges the handover of your vehicle. When the agreed plan is completed, ownership transfers to you.")
B.agY=new A.fA("Ownership","How do I follow my application from my phone?","Your dashboard is built for it: enter your application number and phone number, and see the live status, every recorded step, and a WhatsApp button that carries your number in the message. The link is permanent \u2014 bookmark it.")
